                    "sense_id": "043846d3-7ce6-3363-8ff5-ad1be8201b28",
                    "sense_definition": "So foolish, unreasonable, or out of place as to be amusing or ridiculous.",
                    "learner_level": "B2",
                    "frequency": "Middle",
                    "semantic_group_id": "",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The whole situation became completely <w>farcical</w> when the mayor lost his trousers on live television.",
